{"sounds":{"intro":"Kazakh uses Cyrillic with nine extra letters. There are no genders and no articles. The stress is usually on the last syllable. Learn the special letters first.","rows":[["ә","a short \"a\", like \"cat\"","әке (ah-KEH)"],["ө","say \"oh\" with rounded lips, like German \"ö\"","өзен (uh-ZEN)"],["ү","say \"ee\" with rounded lips, like German \"ü\"","үй (ewy)"],["ұ","a short \"oo\", like \"put\"","ұл (ool)"],["і","a short \"ih\", like \"sit\"","бір (bihr)"],["ғ","gh, like a gargled French \"r\"","тоғыз (toh-GHUHZ)"],["қ","a \"k\" made far back in the throat","қала (kah-LAH)"],["ң","like \"ng\" in \"sing\"","таң (tahng)"],["һ","a breathy \"h\", only in a few borrowed words","Алла"],["ы","a short, flat \"uh\", like the \"a\" in \"about\"","алты (al-TUH)"]],"notes":["Vowel harmony: back vowels (а, о, ұ, ы) go with қ and ғ. Front vowels (ә, е, ө, ү, і) go with к and г. Suffixes follow the same rule."]},"numbers":[{"id":"0-to-10","title":"0 to 10","items":[["zero","нөл","nul"],["one","бір","bihr"],["two","екі","yeh-KEE"],["three","үш","ewsh"],["four","төрт","turt"],["five","бес","bes"],["six","алты","al-TUH"],["seven","жеті","zheh-TEE"],["eight","сегіз","seh-GEEZ"],["nine","тоғыз","toh-GHUHZ"],["ten","он","on"]]},{"id":"11-to-20","title":"11 to 20","items":[["eleven","он бір","on BIHR"],["twelve","он екі","on yeh-KEE"],["thirteen","он үш","on EWSH"],["fourteen","он төрт","on TURT"],["fifteen","он бес","on BES"],["sixteen","он алты","on al-TUH"],["seventeen","он жеті","on zheh-TEE"],["eighteen","он сегіз","on seh-GEEZ"],["nineteen","он тоғыз","on toh-GHUHZ"],["twenty","жиырма","zhee-UHR-mah"]]},{"id":"tens-and-big-numbers","title":"Tens and big numbers","items":[["twenty-one","жиырма бір","zhee-UHR-mah BIHR"],["thirty","отыз","oh-TUHZ"],["forty","қырық","kuh-RUHK"],["fifty","елу","eh-LOO"],["sixty","алпыс","al-PUHS"],["seventy","жетпіс","zhet-PEES"],["eighty","сексен","sek-SEN"],["ninety","тоқсан","tok-SAHN"],["one hundred","жүз","zewz"],["two hundred","ек